 archetype inspired mechs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of build combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level up as you progress through waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select weapons, unique abilities, and traits between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socket weapons with gems to generate powerful effects <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741860/extras/db0b97815b7fdf40d8b2f16279be93fd.poster.avif?t=1788132445\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741860/extras/db0b97815b7fdf40d8b2f16279be93fd.webm?t=1788132445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741860/extras/db0b97815b7fdf40d8b2f16279be93fd.mp4?t=1788132445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Vital Shell is a single player top-down arena shooter that puts you in control of mechs inspired by classic fantasy archetypes. Unlock powerful synergies with unique weapons, traits, and abilities as you take on increasingly challenging waves of enemies in a shattered realm.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Italian, German, Turkish, Portuguese - Portugal", "reviews": "“What might happen if you put Armored Core and Vampire Survivors into opposite ends of the teleporter... folks, it’s pretty dang fun.”<br>Kotaku<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741860/5b034ea593e8c59b4a9fc34d415397eb02cb38f6/header.jpg?t=1788132445", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741860/fb0bff077c8f11ddbc02aeac0e6634fd4857f61d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788132445", "c